## Install

```bash
uv sync --all-extras
```

## Usage

This model implements the following steps (run `meds-model steps` to confirm):

```bash
{% if implements_preprocess %}meds-model preprocess input_dir=$MEDS_ROOT output_dir=data do_reshard=true
{% endif %}{% if implements_unsupervised_train %}meds-model unsupervised_train tensorized_cohort_dir=data output_dir=runs/pretrain
{% endif %}{% if implements_supervised_train %}meds-model supervised_train tensorized_cohort_dir=data labels_dir=$LABELS output_dir=runs/model{% if implements_unsupervised_train %} model_initialization_dir=runs/pretrain{% endif %}
{% endif %}{% if implements_task_agnostic_inference %}meds-model task_agnostic_inference tensorized_cohort_dir=data index=$INDEX model_initialization_dir=runs/model output_dir=runs/infer
{% endif %}{% if implements_prediction %}meds-model prediction tensorized_cohort_dir=data index=$INDEX task=$ACES_YAML model_initialization_dir=runs/model output_dir=runs/preds
{% endif %}```

The final `prediction` step writes `runs/preds/predictions.parquet` in the
[meds-evaluation](https://github.com/kamilest/meds-evaluation) `PredictionSchema`
(`subject_id, prediction_time, predicted_boolean_probability`). **This repo ends at producing predicted
probabilities — evaluation is a separate, shared tool.**

Any extra argument is a Hydra override (e.g. `meds-model supervised_train trainer.max_epochs=50 model.d_model=128`).

## Editing

- **`src/{{ model_slug }}/model.py`** — your `LightningModule`. Edit freely.
- **`src/{{ model_slug }}/steps.py`** — which steps you implement.
- **`src/{{ model_slug }}/configs/model/`** — your model hyperparameters.
- **`src/meds_model_base/`** — the vendored contract (managed by `copier update`; don't edit).

## Testing

```bash
uv run pytest -m "not slow"    # CLI + end-to-end pipeline smoke tests
uv run pytest -m slow          # synthetic-signal learnability property test
```

## Updating the template

```bash
copier update
```
